    <widget class="QLabel" name="infoLabel">
     <property name="text">
      <string>The following data will be replaced in the current scenario:
  • CSD names → &quot;Periodic Income 01&quot;, &quot;Irregular Expense 01&quot;, ...
  • CSD descriptions → Lorem ipsum
  • Scenario name → &quot;Name of the scenario&quot;
  • Scenario description → Lorem ipsum
  • Tag names → &quot;Tag 01&quot;, &quot;Tag 02&quot;, ...
  • Tag descriptions → Lorem ipsum
  • Irregular element notes → Lorem ipsum

The modified scenario stays in memory until you save it.</string>
